<h2 id="sources">Sources and technical notes</h2>
<ol class="article-sources"><li id="source-insag"><a href="https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/publications/PDF/Pub913e_web.pdf">IAEA: The Chernobyl Accident: Updating of INSAG-1, INSAG-7 (1992)</a>. Basis for the accident analysis and qualified chronology. Particularly §§2–5; Annex I §§1-3.8, 1-4.3–1-4.6 and Table I-I; Annex II for modelling. Page references use printed pagination, not PDF viewer numbers.</li><li id="source-nea"><a href="https://oecd-nea.org/jcms/pl_28271/chernobyl-chapter-i-the-site-and-accident-sequence">OECD/NEA: Chernobyl — Assessment of Radiological and Health Impacts, 2002, chapter I</a>. Plant and reactor context. Older simplifications do not override the differentiated INSAG-7 discussion.</li><li id="source-unscear"><a href="https://www.unscear.org/unscear/en/areas-of-work/chernobyl.html">UNSCEAR: Assessments of radiation effects from the Chornobyl accident</a>. Access to reports on exposure and health consequences; distinguish their respective reporting periods.</li><li id="source-imis"><a href="https://www.bundesumweltministerium.de/themen/strahlenschutz/ionisierende-strahlung/ueberwachung-der-radioaktivitaet-in-der-umwelt">German Federal Environment Ministry: environmental radioactivity monitoring</a> and <a href="https://www.berlin.de/sen/uvk/umwelt/atom-und-strahlenschutz/umweltradioaktivitaet/imis/">Berlin Senate: IMIS</a>. Official context for developments after 1986.</li><li id="source-odl"><a href="https://odlinfo.bfs.de/">Federal Office for Radiation Protection: ODL-Info</a>. Measurement principle and network, rather than proof of the historical school location. <a href="https://media04.kreiszeitung-wochenblatt.de/article/2021/12/08/4/469134_XXL.jpg">The comparison photograph I supplied from a neighbouring town</a> is a visual reference for the shape only. It is not republished here as my image or a historical school photograph.</li></ol>
<p class="article-note">Sources checked on 16 October 2026. Personal recollection: Dennis Hilk. Design, diagrams and interface captures: original museum reconstruction. No connection to a plant, operational reactor simulation or plant operating instructions.</p>
